/* 7b. N4-D0 read-only clock baseline.  Snapshot the clock/DPLL/mux/
 *     voltage/UART1 configuration the Tier-1 bootloader left behind.
 *     Strictly getreg32 + diagnostic putc -- no DPLL/mux/clock-control/
